{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"He takes a breath. Dips in the last of his melting ice cube into his hot cocoa, and drinks for a solid 20 seconds","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:58:43.089000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-26T03:58:49.044000Z","id":"869066177098448908","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Death has... Taken its toll, made me think about a lot of things. Brought back a lot of memories. I was prepared to die forever if there wasn't an option that kept me as I am. I kind of reflected on if I was happy with my life. There were many joyful times I am grateful for. \"","created_at":"2021-07-26T04:00:54.117000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-26T04:01:50.226000Z","id":"869066726669701161","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"She nods \"Is there a but?\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T04:01:56.866000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869066989858082828","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
