{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"She's quiet then nods slowly \"That makes sense. I don't really think I could picture you as anything else than you.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T04:05:23.936000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869067858372620310","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
