{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"'...hmm.' she doesn't look convinced.","created_at":"2021-07-30T10:03:06.504000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870607430369816587","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"'Being alive is strange.'","created_at":"2021-07-30T10:03:33.021000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870607541590192128","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Can't disagree with that.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T10:03:55.542000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870607636050092052","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"'I guess I can't really say anything about having to trick the world into letting you function, though. I... still don't know how I did, even on a purely physical level.'","created_at":"2021-07-30T10:05:05.689000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870607930267951155","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"You just don't really think about it, I suppose. Just go about your business, and eventually the world will catch up.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T10:09:31.787000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870609046363852820","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"'..I've still got a lot to learn about things. I have basic knowledge, but... I suppose it's difficult to be an adult with few memories at the best of times, let alone with all the other circumstances.'","created_at":"2021-07-30T10:12:02.798000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870609679749902376","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Well, among shifters we tend to count as adults well before twenty, but even then it's not difficult to be up to speed when you're part of the swarm.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T10:15:38.108000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870610582825484298","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"'...honestly, I'm not even sure how old I am. I want to say mid-twenties, but... it's hard to be sure.'","created_at":"2021-07-30T10:16:32.516000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870610811029159936","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"Roy shrugs. \"I'm not 20 yet myself.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T10:20:30.958000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870611811127427122","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"(haha smol)","created_at":"2021-07-30T10:20:52.604000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870611901917306881","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"'What is worrying is that I don't know how far into my life I am. If I could just find out what I was before, I could at least approximate it with this form...'","created_at":"2021-07-30T10:22:59.613000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870612434631688263","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"'...I guess that's part of seizing the day, though. I don't know how long I have left in multiple different ways. So I should use it how I can.'","created_at":"2021-07-30T10:24:09.316000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870612726987255818","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
